{"3399480": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "BREAKPOINT: Viper Squad", "steam_appid": 3399480, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOU ARE THE WEAPON</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Viper Squad is a squad-based FPS built around one dangerous idea:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The stronger you become, the closer you get to breaking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your Overload during combat to push your abilities beyond their limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But keep pushing and you'll hit the Breakpoint.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When that happens, your squad has seconds to save you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight harder. Push further. Don't lose control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399480/extras/9e87e255ce70108ffd30699761da6b5b.avif?t=1787419841\" width=1364 height=768 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PUSH YOUR LIMIT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overload is the heart of Viper Squad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your actions build charge during combat, giving you more power and greater combat potential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But power isn't free.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push too far and your Overload becomes unstable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your squad can keep you alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or watch you explode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOU DON'T SURVIVE ALONE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Viper Squad is built around squad coordination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push aggressively, cover your teammates, and keep overloaded players alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The best squad isn't necessarily the one with the best aim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's the one that knows when to push and when to pull someone back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FAST. TACTICAL. DANGEROUS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WEAPONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Choose your loadout</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399480/extras/7c45c6516b9375e89bb70670dd3d97b5.poster.avif?t=1787419841\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399480/extras/7c45c6516b9375e89bb70670dd3d97b5.webm?t=1787419841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399480/extras/7c45c6516b9375e89bb70670dd3d97b5.mp4?t=1787419841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABILITIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Master your abilities</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399480/extras/20515bf1cdbcfa71cca694d96345131e.avif?t=1787419841\" width=1552 height=874 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MOVEMENT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Control the fight</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MODES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>PRIMARY</strong></i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OVERLOAD</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>SECONDARY</strong></i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team Deathmatch</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Objective Modes</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom Matches</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>SOLO</strong></i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Training / AI</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399480/extras/268bed0c5d7ddb2466a1e9cf43b14081.poster.avif?t=1787419841\" width=1170 height=664 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399480/extras/268bed0c5d7ddb2466a1e9cf43b14081.webm?t=1787419841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399480/extras/268bed0c5d7ddb2466a1e9cf43b14081.mp4?t=1787419841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAY EVEN WHEN THE SERVERS ARE QUIET</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to practice?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn the weapons, experiment with abilities, and fight AI opponents while you're waiting for other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR EXOSUIT</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock weapons, improve your loadout, climb the ranks, and build your own way to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399480/extras/da395072609a498d950f08c43bb7f2e5.avif?t=1787419841\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399480/extras_big/da395072609a498d950f08c43bb7f2e5.avif?t=1787419841 width=800 height=452 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOU ARE THE WEAPON</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Viper Squad is a squad-based FPS built around one dangerous idea:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The stronger you become, the closer you get to breaking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your Overload during combat to push your abilities beyond their limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But keep pushing and you'll hit the Breakpoint.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When that happens, your squad has seconds to save you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight harder. Push further. Don't lose control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399480/extras/9e87e255ce70108ffd30699761da6b5b.avif?t=1787419841\" width=1364 height=768 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PUSH YOUR LIMIT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overload is the heart of Viper Squad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your actions build charge during combat, giving you more power and greater combat potential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But power isn't free.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push too far and your Overload becomes unstable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your squad can keep you alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or watch you explode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOU DON'T SURVIVE ALONE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Viper Squad is built around squad coordination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push aggressively, cover your teammates, and keep overloaded players alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The best squad isn't necessarily the one with the best aim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's the one that knows when to push and when to pull someone back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FAST. TACTICAL. DANGEROUS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WEAPONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Choose your loadout</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399480/e